# Product Philosophy (loaded only for scope/positioning decisions)

This project builds an **AI Sales Employee**. It is **not** primarily:

- a generic CMS
- a generic CRM
- a Facebook bot

When a task could push the product back toward one of those generic framings (e.g. "just add a
CRUD screen for X" without the AI-employee angle), flag it and ask before proceeding.
